{
  "title": "Quick Roasted Dutch Meat Casserole",
  "description": "A hearty and flavorful Dutch dish featuring roasted meat and white wine, perfect for a weeknight dinner. This recipe is kid-friendly and anti-inflammatory-friendly.",
  "cuisine": "Dutch",
